sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant V as voice screen
  participant SR as th-TH speech recognizer<br/>(phone / browser)
  participant VP as domain/voice.ts
  participant P as AppProvider/Repo
  U->>V: Tap mic (permission asked once)
  U->>SR: Say "rice 50 baht, water 15"
  SR-->>V: recognized text
  V->>VP: parseSpokenEntry(text)
  VP-->>V: 2 drafts (rice ฿50 Food, water ฿15)
  U->>V: Edit / switch income-expense / remove, then Save
  V->>P: save confirmed values only
  P-->>U: balance updates immediately (no audio stored)
